      "t": "In the dining room, celebrity host Dmitriy Nagiyev grandly invites the wedding guests to take their seats while stumbling over the groom's name, as the plate-smashing guest continues his spree. Over at the bar, Nastya abruptly changes tactics and starts telling Kostya how wonderful he is.",
